### ScarborMusic — Auth API Tests
### Compatible with: VS Code REST Client, JetBrains HTTP Client, httpYac
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Send Verification Code
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1a. Send code for registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/send-code
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "type": "register"
}

### Expected Response (200):
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "message": "Verification code sent to test@example.com...",
#   "data": { "email": "test@example.com" }
# }

### 1b. Send code for password reset
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/send-code
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "type": "reset_password"
}

### 1c. Invalid email (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/send-code
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "not-an-email"
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. Register
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2a. Register new user (replace CODE with the code from step 1)
# In dev mode, check the server console for the 6-digit code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "Test1234",
  "confirmPassword": "Test1234",
  "code": "REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_CODE"
}

### Expected Response (201):
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "message": "Account created successfully",
#   "data": {
#     "user": { "id": "...", "email": "...", "username": "...", "role": "USER" },
#     "accessToken": "eyJ..."
#   }
# }
# Cookies set: access_token (15min), refresh_token (7 days)

### 2b. Duplicate email (should return 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "username": "anotheruser",
  "password": "Test1234",
  "confirmPassword": "Test1234",
  "code": "000000"
}

### 2c. Weak password (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "weak@example.com",
  "username": "weakuser",
  "password": "password",
  "confirmPassword": "password",
  "code": "123456"
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. Login
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3a. Login with valid credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### Expected Response (200):
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "message": "Login successful",
#   "data": {
#     "user": { "id": "...", "email": "...", "username": "...", "role": "USER" },
#     "accessToken": "eyJ..."
#   }
# }

### 3b. Wrong password (should return 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 3c. Non-existent email (should return 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "nobody@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4. Refresh Token
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Note: The refresh_token cookie is set automatically by the login/register
# responses. The REST Client will send it automatically if cookies are enabled.

### 4a. Refresh access token (requires refresh_token cookie from login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Expected Response (200):
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "message": "Token refreshed",
#   "data": { "accessToken": "eyJ..." }
# }

### 4b. No refresh token (should return 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: refresh_token=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 5. Logout
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 5a. Logout (requires access_token cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Expected Response (200):
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "message": "Logged out successfully",
#   "data": null
# }
# Cookies cleared: access_token, refresh_token

### 5b. Logout via GET (for browser link usage)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
